{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-224279","model_call":17,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q553"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q553"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_1153064887#3_2565126402","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q553","rank":4,"snippet":"\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_1153064887#3_2565126402\" , \"end_char\": 2584.000000 , \"headings\": \"Why You Should Use Reflective Practice<cover>Why You Should Use Reflective Practice Emily Coleman What is Reflective Practice? What are the Benefits of Reflective Practice? How to Get Started with Reflective Practice Journaling Peer Observation Research New Theories Curriculum Development Student Surveys Involvement in School Change \" , \"segment\": \"They can help administrators decide what professional development would be most helpful at that time. Day-to-day responsibilities and actions are always changing in schools. When teachers participate in reflective practice, they are able to respond in a positive way to change. Reflective practice pushes teachers to update their lesson plans to reach the current needs of the students in front of them. Every year, students change. Therefore, they will have different needs than the students in the past year. Evaluating our teaching </cover>methods will help us keep all students engaged. How to Get Started with Reflective Practice Journaling Getting started with reflective practice does not need to be overwhelming. As stated above, journaling at the end of "},"time":10},"model_calls":17,"document_judgments":13,"relevance_3":9,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
