{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-224279","model_call":28,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ teachers \"continuous improvement\" (+ instruction teaching practice) (+ reflection reflective) \"student learning\")"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ teachers \"continuous improvement\" (+ instruction teaching practice) (+ reflection reflective) \"student learning\")"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_6250596#5_10391822","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q561","rank":1,"snippet":"Incorporate structured, formalized time and resources for coaching, collaboration, and reflection into professional development programs. Encourage teachers to use collaboration and reflection opportunities to explore the relationship between the professional development provided and the impact on <cover>student learning. Use TBTs or communities of learners to provide these opportunities. Back to Top Use teacher evaluation data to inform professional development needs. Align professional development and evaluation in a way that is compliant with the requirements of HB 153 passed by the 129th Ohio General Assembly. Back to Top Why It Is Important Sustained, aligned, intensive professional development that is connected to practice is essential for improving teaching because it provides teachers with time and resources to develop reflective and relevant practices that can lead to mastery of content and pedagogy. In addition to improving teachers’ instructional practice, high-quality professional development can create a more collaborative and more professional school culture. Back to Top 2. Align professional development with the district/school Comprehensive Continuous Improvement </cover>Plan Why It Is Important Aligning professional development with the district continuous improvement plan (CIP) and school improvement plan (SIP) ensures that teachers are working to improve instruction in the areas the district and school have "},"time":96},"model_calls":28,"document_judgments":21,"relevance_3":14,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
