{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-224279","model_call":44,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q571"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q571"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_1618153226#1_3400085386","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q571","rank":3,"snippet":"access daily workflows to help <cover>improve teachers’ workday. Our technology helps teachers to spend less time on administration, more time on education, and to get back time at the end of their day. It also empowers teachers with real-time insights into student progress such that teachers can target growth areas, watch the light bulb turn on, and truly celebrate with students when they show successful growth. When Pennsylvania’s Hatboro-Horsham School District was looking for a new student information system in 2002, its primary goal was a system offering real-time student data and a parent portal for improved communication with families. But what it received was a comprehensive solution that transformed its entire system of business practices and impacted the lives of teachers. “ Teachers save many hours because they no longer have to calculate their standards by hand,” Denise Schlorff, Coordinator of Information Technology. View Case Study Nothing beats knowing you’ve made a difference in the life and education of a child What we find exciting at PowerSchool is that our technology provides easy-to-digest data insights to teachers about their students and classes that enable them to adjust instruction </cover>in real-time. PowerSchool allows "},"time":15},"model_calls":44,"document_judgments":32,"relevance_3":20,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
